From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nowon <nowon@noreply.pepecoin.surf>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:27:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 100/144] GreatDANE: drop the bundled Grokipedia (xAI) icon;
 use our own neutral letter tile (coordinator ruling)

- Removed browser/components/topsites/content/tippytop/images/grokipedia-com@2x.png and
  favicons/grokipedia-com.png. Both were derived from the live site's favicon, which is xAI's mark.
- The exact-host tippytop entry for grokipedia.com now points to images/grokipedia-com-letter@2x.png and
  favicons/grokipedia-com-letter.png: a white sans-serif "G" (DejaVu Sans Bold) on solid #4a5568,
  generated by greatdane/tools/make_letter_tile.py (reproducible).
- Keeping a tippytop entry is the narrowest way to stop the startup screenshot capture of that default tile.
  It changes no pref and doesn't disable screenshots globally.
- greatdane/tippytop-ICON-SOURCES.md: the third-party source row is removed, and the choice is documented.
